{"id":"7be1909fc471247e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree.md","title":"ZFC Desc Silver Tree","display":"df-zfc-desc-silver-tree — ZFC Desc Silver Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree","58-df-zfc-tree8-silver-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-silver-tree — ZFC Desc Silver Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree</span><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-silver-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-silver-tree — ZFC Desc Silver Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,s,t\\in V\">\\(T,s,t\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SilverTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SilverTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\">\\(A^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}\\)</span>；有限序列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}(s)=|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}(s)=|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\)</span>。 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in A^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),a\\rangle\\}\">\\(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),a\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}silver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq 2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land \\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\land \\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\left(|s|=|t|\\to\\{i\\in2\\mid s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\}=\\{i\\in2\\mid t^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}silver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq 2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land \\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\land \\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\left(|s|=|t|\\to\\{i\\in2\\mid s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\}=\\{i\\in2\\mid t^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}silver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SilverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}silver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SilverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-tree8-silver-tree</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>Equality of the complete successor-bit sets also synchronizes the unique successor at nonsplitting levels; merely synchronizing whether both successors occur would be too weak.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTree8SilverTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{s\\in\\mathcal P(n\\times A):\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}(s)=|s|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in A^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\coloneqq s\\cup\\{\\langle\\operatorname{dom}(s),a\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}silver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq 2^{<\\omega}\\land \\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\land \\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\left(|s|=|t|\\to\\{i\\in2\\mid s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\}=\\{i\\in2\\mid t^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\in T\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}silver\\text{-}tree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree8SilverTree}_S(T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescSilverTree}_S(T)","display":true}],"bytes":1689,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1799","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree.md|58-df-zfc-desc-silver-tree]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","aba489b7551a80b3","36d7463d215be751"]}